      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BINNAWAY MIRAGE (2) is struggling to break through but racing consistently, finishing in the minors five starts on end. Last time out flew the lids with a fast early sectional but gathered in and finished in the minors when second (22.85) at this track over 400m. Didn't win last time but still ran one of the quickest times on the card. Overdue and is among the main hopes. PAW SHAYNA (1) missed the frame and was safely held latest finishing 6th at Angle Park following on from a second place finish (30.98) there the start prior. Has ability and can atone. PARRAKIE (7) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing fourth (25.91) in a Grade 5 at Murray Bridge. Form at the trip sound including four wins. Safe beginner but wide box to overcome and will need some luck. Leading chance. GOLDIE RUSTY (5) warrants respect following a recent placing over this course and distance.",
